    "architecturalHeights": "Ordinary-picture/map visualization estimates, not surveyed dimensions: approximately38.9m church length/18.5m west-front width, nave19m eaves/22m tile ridge, western stone screen24.2m, tower pinnacles29m/cross30m, center cross29m. Cloister lower arcade5m, upper glazed arcade/eaves9m, higher white outer ranges12m/terracotta ridges14m. Specific sculpture, bay subdivisions, concealed roofs and exact floor/stair levels remain approximate."
