    "Original standard6m Mapzen ground/water and all independent buildings retained. Each mapped structure has a small grade-buried local plinth; cloister courts stay native ground, entrance has short descending steps. No broad monastery/plaza slab, flattening or ground/water cutout. Coarse urban DEM does not resolve actual paved court/plaza floors or thresholds; absolute heights and approaches remain approximate.",
